WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.262 --> 00:00:03.197
- The power of a group
of women skating together

00:00:03.197 --> 00:00:04.780
is freedom charged.

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:07.873
It's just so empowering.

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:09.112
Yeah, it's amazing.

00:00:09.112 --> 00:00:11.945
(energetic music)

00:00:17.247 --> 00:00:18.938
My name is Valeria Kechichian

00:00:18.938 --> 00:00:20.859
and I'm the co-founder and director

00:00:20.859 --> 00:00:22.689
of Longboard Girls Crew.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:26.379
Longboard Girls Crew is an
international longboard community

00:00:26.379 --> 00:00:29.423
that supports and promotes
women in action sports.

00:00:29.423 --> 00:00:33.852
It's trying to shift the
way women are perceived

00:00:33.852 --> 00:00:35.772
by society, by the industry

00:00:35.772 --> 00:00:37.855
and mostly by themselves.

00:00:38.965 --> 00:00:41.138
The way the industry has been showing us

00:00:41.138 --> 00:00:44.117
it's like in a really sexualized way.

00:00:44.117 --> 00:00:46.273
The main thing that is missing for women

00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:49.441
in the action sports industry is exposure.

00:00:49.441 --> 00:00:52.536
Sometimes, we need to see
someone else doing something

00:00:52.536 --> 00:00:55.409
to believe that we also can.

00:00:55.409 --> 00:00:59.835
We started it with a friend
in Madrid back in 2010.

00:00:59.835 --> 00:01:02.534
At first we wanted to get
more girls into the sport

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:05.403
'cause it was really male
dominated and we realized

00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:08.249
when the two or three
girls that skated in Madrid

00:01:08.249 --> 00:01:10.395
we got together, the
energy was so different

00:01:10.395 --> 00:01:13.321
from when we skated with boys.

00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:15.789
So we wanted to create
more of those moments.

00:01:15.789 --> 00:01:17.709
I thought, "Why don't we shoot a video

00:01:17.709 --> 00:01:20.294
of all these girls skating together?"

00:01:20.294 --> 00:01:21.176
After the first video,

00:01:21.176 --> 00:01:23.271
everything kind of exploded a little bit

00:01:23.271 --> 00:01:25.016
and the video became viral.

00:01:25.016 --> 00:01:29.644
We portray women all shapes
and colors, sizes, religion.

00:01:29.644 --> 00:01:31.739
The response of women was immediate

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:35.130
and the movement just grew worldwide.

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:38.462
Longboard Girls Crew is
in more than 80 countries.

00:01:38.462 --> 00:01:39.914
It's really, it's really beautiful

00:01:39.914 --> 00:01:42.427
to get all these emails
from around the world

00:01:42.427 --> 00:01:45.451
from women telling us how
they started longboarding

00:01:45.451 --> 00:01:49.996
because of one of our
videos or for the movement.

00:01:49.996 --> 00:01:52.693
What I want women to see when
they see Longboard Girls Crew

00:01:52.693 --> 00:01:54.785
is that they can do it, too.

00:01:54.785 --> 00:01:56.248
It doesn't matter how you look

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:58.308
and it doesn't matter
what you've been told

00:01:58.308 --> 00:02:00.729
is for girls or is for boys.

00:02:00.729 --> 00:02:02.038
You can do anything.

00:02:02.038 --> 00:02:04.871
(energetic music)

